{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Lucky Mayor",
    "steam_appid": 2659970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659970/extras/18e58d0d202ee4c129d75742a742c779.avif?t=1720252883\" width=450 height=500 /></span><br>In this roguelike mayor simulation game, you will become the leader of a city, taking on the role of a mayor. Your task is to recruit citizens, promote business prosperity, and establish a comprehensive industrial chain to meet the diverse needs of the population. Through wise planning and decision-making, transform your city into a thriving supercity that citizens take pride in, and become their admired leader!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659970/extras/ebd0b4bf454c8b7a30d3df697dda9ba7.avif?t=1720252883\" width=444 height=250 /></span><br>We have an extensive deck of cards, currently with over 150 citizens available for use, each with their unique abilities and preferences.<br><br>You need to meet the citizens' preferences to earn coins and, by the final deadline, obtain enough coins to prove that you are a capable mayor.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659970/extras/f5212274b0c57182841404279495a37e.avif?t=1720252883\" width=444 height=250 /></span><br>We also have a wide range of items and different difficulty levels to enrich your gaming experience, and the development team will continue to provide updates for even more game content.<br><br>Please follow us on Discord, and we will be delighted to hear your thoughts and feedback on the game.<br><br><strong>Press F8 to enable screen reader functionality.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659970/extras/18e58d0d202ee4c129d75742a742c779.avif?t=1720252883\" width=450 height=500 /></span><br>In this roguelike mayor simulation game, you will become the leader of a city, taking on the role of a mayor. Your task is to recruit citizens, promote business prosperity, and establish a comprehensive industrial chain to meet the diverse needs of the population. Through wise planning and decision-making, transform your city into a thriving supercity that citizens take pride in, and become their admired leader!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659970/extras/ebd0b4bf454c8b7a30d3df697dda9ba7.avif?t=1720252883\" width=444 height=250 /></span><br>We have an extensive deck of cards, currently with over 150 citizens available for use, each with their unique abilities and preferences.<br><br>You need to meet the citizens' preferences to earn coins and, by the final deadline, obtain enough coins to prove that you are a capable mayor.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659970/extras/f5212274b0c57182841404279495a37e.avif?t=1720252883\" width=444 height=250 /></span><br>We also have a wide range of items and different difficulty levels to enrich your gaming experience, and the development team will continue to provide updates for even more game content.<br><br>Please follow us on Discord, and we will be delighted to hear your thoughts and feedback on the game.<br><br><strong>Press F8 to enable screen reader functionality.</strong>",
    "short_description": "This is a Rogue Deck-building game where you play as a mayor, recruit various citizens to earn coins, meet their needs, and submit enough coins by the deadline to complete challenges.",
    "supported_languages": "English, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Vietnamese, French",
